MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- LIBYA_TZ (Africa/Tripoli, UTC+2) + now_libya() in notifier, excel_generator,
  evolution_tracker, cover_letter_generator, interview_prep; scanner main flow
  uses Libya dates for Excel filename, scan time and email subject
- 00:11 Libya now reads as 2026-09-06, not 22:11 on 2026-09-05 UTC
- HUMAN_GREETINGS: 3 per scan slot (Morning/Afternoon/Night), rotate by (hour+minute)%3
- HUMAN_CLOSINGS: 4, rotate by (minute+second)%4
- 0-match notes: 3 variants, picked by stable hash of (date+scan_num)%3
- Telegram header: '🌙 Night Digest — Sunday, September 06, 2026 — 12:31 AM Libya'
  + rotating human greeting line
- Excel: 'Live as of 12:31 AM Libya' titles, market_pulse by hour
  (Morning fresh before US wakes / Mid-day European wave / Night less
  competition), rotating human_note, Daily Log in Libya time
- evolution_tracker: Libya day boundary for brain/streaks + '🕐 Live as of …'
  phase line that varies by hour
- cover letters: PDF date lines + file names in Libya time

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
